          "summary": "<p>财新网08月17日电: 沪指开盘报3930.10点，涨幅0.07%。</p><p>深成指报14399.20点，涨幅0.31%；创业板指报3632.78点，涨幅0.18%；中小板指报8835.63点，涨幅0.42%。</p><p>盘面上，有色金属领涨，轻工制造、电子、通信、农林牧渔、基础化工等板块涨幅居前，食品饮料领跌，医药生物、公用事业、计算机、银行、煤炭等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，7月金融数据“成绩单”出炉；银行存款利率总体延续下行趋势，五年期平均利率环比上涨；广东省首个词元经济专项金融产品“Token贷”在广州海珠发布；段永平、张磊、李录等大佬二季度买了什么？半导体投资分歧大；国家体育总局表示坚决反对任何形式“追私”行为；消息称英伟达大幅收缩对OpenAI数据中心的融资担保，减少1300亿美元；非沪籍居民及境外人士置换性购房政策微调？上海房地产交易中心热线回应。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-08-17</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001331\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001331\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">东方财富<p><span class=\"stock-no\">300059.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.45</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">中信证券伦交所ESG评级较上年下降至B，位居A股同行业50家公司第11名，与国泰海通等同级、高于东方财富等、低于第一创业等</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002000\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002000\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">中联重科<p><span class=\"stock-no\">000157.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.45</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">ST太重伦交所ESG评级较上年下降至C，位居GICS三级机械制造行业41家公司第27名，与中联重科等同级、高于科达制造、低于日月股份等</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101022007\"><div class=\"row-order\">3</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101022007\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">宇树科技<p><span class=\"stock-no\">688836.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">宇树科技上市立起产业估值锚行业从烧钱讲故事迈入盈利验证新阶段</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101014216\"><div class=\"row-order\">4</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101014216\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">日月股份<p><span class=\"stock-no\">603218.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">ST太重伦交所ESG评级较上年下降至C，位居GICS三级机械制造行业41家公司第27名，与中联重科等同级、高于科达制造、低于日月股份等</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001754\"><div class=\"row-order\">5</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001754\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">上海临港<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600848.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">6.24</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+6.24</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">首开股份伦交所ESG评级较上年下降至B-，位居GICS三级房地产管理和开发行业29家公司第7名，与招商蛇口等同级、高于市北高新等、低于上海临港等</div></a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"yqzszb-infomation\"><ul><li>今日敏感舆情指数，面向所有A股上市公司，以其前一日9:00至当日9:00的敏感新闻和公告信息为基础，建立模型计算出的0-100的指数，用来表征该上市公司舆情敏感程度的高低。</li><li>本文列举了今日指数最高的5只股票，同时列举了今日指数较昨日的涨跌值，以及时间段内主要的敏感新闻之一。</li><li>获取更多上市公司信息和其他高级服务，请查阅<span><a href=\"http://database.caixin.com\">财新数据通</a></span>。</li><li>本报告基于大数据技术